          "officialWholeSourceCredit": false,
          "sourceContext": "Original NI KC Chemie SekII2022, printed/physical p26: general subject competences apply galvanic-cell knowledge to local cells, distinguish oxygen/acid corrosion, and explain sacrificial-anode protection. Separate inquiry/evaluation columns require actual corrosion/iron-ion/protection experiments and economic consequences. P47 supplies a teaching context; it does not replace the course markings on p26.",
          "sourceLimit": "Core local-cell/sacrificial-protection explanation has explicit source support. The whole unchanged642d P, including differential aeration, surface/contact conditions, maintenance, kinetic limits and external-current transfer, is the proposed own SkillPilot foundation. No official exact whole-profile mapping or execution/evaluation credit is created.",
          "acquisitionScope": "Whole unchanged642d goal/P: correct anodic/cathodic half-reactions, electron and ion paths, barrier/sacrificial effects and defects, conditional area/rate reasoning, contact and aeration transfer, and a testable maintenance plan without invented measured success. Supplied paper/model cases are not a real corrosion experiment.",
